blurb: The board held a budget workshop for the FY25Budget, featuring presentations
  from the Special Education, Adult Education, Athletics, and Operations & Safety
  departments. The superintendent also addressed the future of the Extended Learning
  Opportunities (ELO) program, committing to its continuation despite the loss of
  grant funding.
